{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>An Alien Threat Has Emerged in the City of Cynosure!</strong></u>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking the form of ghostly silhouettes, these aliens force whoever they touch to take on monstrous new forms. Though they are immune to physical attacks and traditional weaponry,<i>\u00a0Yani Gesedes</i>\u00a0of <i>Wonder Labs</i> develops a new kind of weapon; The<i> Wonder Blaster!</i>\u00a0This weapon forces the aliens  to assume physical forms for capture, and allow for research of this bizarre new phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Featuring...</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 fun filled mazes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-Player  Co-op! (Multiplayer requires at least one gamepad!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Player Versus in the 8 Bonus\u00a0<i>Party Modes!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Unlockable Color Palettes to Customize Your Character With!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 difficulty modifiers for challenge seekers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story for the ages!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put an end to this Extraterrestrial War in Wonder Warp!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734700?t=1755009996","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734700?t=1755009996","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734700/3fdd217d0fdc1ae8a30195418602f6188d6fca8c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755009996","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734700/3fdd217d0fdc1ae8a30195418602f6188d6fca8c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755009996","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"descr